---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---

<InfoPage
  lang="en"
  title="Contact Us"
  heading="Contact & Feedback"
  description="Get in touch with the ToolsOfTools team for inquiries, bug reports, and formula corrections."
>
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <p>
      We welcome questions, formula verification inquiries, suggestions for new calculators, or bug reports.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Email</h2>
    <p>
      You can reach our engineering team directly at:
      <br />
      <a href="mailto:support@toolsoftools.com" class="font-mono text-neutral-900 underline dark:text-white">
        support@toolsoftools.com
      </a>
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Reporting Calculation Discrepancies</h2>
    <p>
      If you discover a formula discrepancy or outdated tax slab/financial rule, please include the relevant tool URL, the inputs tested, and the official regulatory or statutory reference so our audit team can swiftly review and verify the math.
    </p>
  </section>
</InfoPage>
